        ecrm:P3_has_note    "White satin bodice, skirt and collar, bodice fastening in front with spiral buttons, 3/4 length sleeves. Skirt assymetrically draped with horizontal folds across the left hip, very full over the right. Trimmed with lace, ribbons and sprigs of orange blossom, long train edged with bobbin lace. Deep collar of unstitched pin-tucks finished with a pleated frill of net"@en ;
